@startuml sequence-bank-request
title Request to the bank
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

queue "Kafka" as Kafka
box "webhook-service" #F5F9FF
    participant "BankRequestConsumer" as Cons
    participant "FakePaymentProviderAdapter" as Ad
    participant "OutcomeKafkaProducer" as Prod
end box
participant "fake-payment-provider" as Bank

Kafka -> Cons: DepositRequested / WithdrawalRequested
Cons -> Ad: send
Ad -> Bank: POST /api/v1/transactions (amount = total, CARD)\nor /api/v1/payouts (amount, BANK_TRANSFER)\nexternalId = transactionId, notificationUrl, metadata.userId\nBasic Auth (client from Nexus)
alt 201 / 200: accepted or a repeat
    Ad -> Ad: the outcome comes by webhook
else 400: the bank refused (LIMIT_EXCEEDED, VALIDATION_ERROR, IDEMPOTENCY_CONFLICT)
    Ad -> Prod: *Failed (reason from the bank)
    Prod -> Kafka: send, wait for the ack
else 401 / connection refused: the bank created nothing
    Ad -> Bank: short retries
    Ad -> Prod: still failing → *Failed PROVIDER_UNAVAILABLE + alert
    Prod -> Kafka: send, wait for the ack
else timeout / broken connection / 5xx: outcome unknown
    Ad -> Bank: retry POST with the same externalId
    Ad -> Kafka: bank silent too long → DLT + alert, no *Failed
    note right: the bank may have paid;\nsupport checks it by GET /transactions/{id}
end
Cons -> Kafka: commit offset
note over Kafka, Bank: Kafka ack missing → offset not committed → the event is read again; the bank answers 200 by externalId
@enduml
